  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating efforts to End Child Marriage in Ghana &#x2013; UPR follow up</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting interventions by UNICEF that are related in ending child marriage and SGBV in Ghana as well as contributing to SDG 5.3 to eliminate all harmful practices, such as child, early and forced marriage and FGM. The outcome is that adolescent girls that are at risk of and affected by child marriage are better able to express and exercise their choices as well as households demonstrating positive attitudes and behaviours toward investing in and supporting adolescent girls.</narrative>
  </description>
